# libretranslate
msgid "**AI assistance inside the applications you already run.** A gateway role, *svc-ai-litellm*, fronts OpenAI, Anthropic and OpenRouter from declared keys, with *svc-ai-ollama* and the new *svc-ai-lmstudio* serving local models from one shared catalogue, so inference can stay inside the deployment. Sixteen applications use it for their own built-in AI features instead of calling a vendor directly: WordPress AI Engine, MediaWiki AIEditingAssistant, Moodle's AI subsystem, Zammad Smart Assist, the xWiki LLM extension, Discourse AI, the Matrix ChatGPT bridge, Nextcloud, Mattermost Agents, n8n, Open WebUI and Flowise. The gateway's admin UI signs in through Keycloak. See [svc-ai-litellm](roles/svc-ai-litellm/README.md) and [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."
msgstr "**Axuda dentro das aplicacións que xa executas.** papel de porta de entrada, *svc-ai-litellm*, frontes OpenAI, Antropic e OpenRouter de claves declaradas. *svc-ai-ollama* E o novo *svc-ai-lmstudio* Servir modelos locais dun catálogo compartido, polo que a inferencia pode permanecer dentro da implementación. Dezaseis aplicacións úsao para as súas propias características de IA integradas en lugar de chamar directamente a un vendedor: WordPress AI Engine, MediaWiki AIEditingAssistant, subsistema de IA de Moodle, Zammad Smart Assist, a extensión xWiki LLM, Discourse AI, a ponte Matrix ChatGPT, Nextcloud, Agents Mattermost, n8Open WebUI e Flowise. O administrador da pasarela UI asina a través de Keycloak. Ver [svc-ai-litellm](roles/svc-ai-litellm/README.md) e [svc-ai-lmstudio](roles/svc-ai-lmstudio/README.md)."

