msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Non estar alerta ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao mantén o espazo de nomes métricos de Vault, e emite un nodo non selado saudable. ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, Unha alerta en ``== 0`` Incendios permanentes. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 mentres se pecha); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborados."

