msgstr "**Deps externos:** Protocolo PDS (Ler/escribir calendarios), AT Protocol relay/firehose para a agregación e opcionalmente Meilisearch."

# libretranslate
msgid "**External drift monitoring.** Addon freshness is checked by opt-in external tests under `tests/external/update/addons/`. These tests are warn-only, emit GitHub Actions warning annotations, and are excluded from `make test` in the same way as Docker image and repository-ref external update checks."
msgstr "**Control de deriva externa.** A frescura de Addon é revisada por opt-in probas externas baixo `tests/external/update/addons/`. Estas probas son só avisadas, emiten anotacións de advertencia de GitHub e están excluídas das probas. `make test` Docker image e repository-ref externa update checks."

# libretranslate
msgid "**External/central PostgreSQL and Redis:** rails ``database.yml``, ``resque.yml``, ``cable.yml`` and the workhorse config are pre-rendered by Ansible and mounted read-only."
msgstr "**PostgreSQL e Redis:** Rails ``database.yml``, ``resque.yml``, ``cable.yml`` E a configuración do workhorse é precedida por Ansible e montado só lectura."

# libretranslate
msgid "**External/central PostgreSQL and Redis:** rails `database.yml`, `resque.yml`, `cable.yml` and the workhorse config are pre-rendered by Ansible and mounted read-only."
msgstr "**PostgreSQL e Redis:** Rails `database.yml`, `resque.yml`, `cable.yml` E a configuración do workhorse é precedida por Ansible e montado só lectura."

# libretranslate
