# libretranslate
msgid "**Federated Social Network:** Connects with other BookWyrm instances and ActivityPub platforms."
msgstr "**Rede Social Federada:** Conecta con outras instancias de BookWyrm e outras plataformas de ActivityPub."

# libretranslate
