# libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the ``sso`` service flag. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the ``administrator`` profile via the backend PREPL (``enable-prepl-server``) in ``tasks/main.yml`` — ``create-profile`` for a fresh profile, ``update-profile`` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Nativos** Login de correo electrónico / contrasinal *Fóra* O IDC é o camiño de login (Forzas SSO), *Sobre* O contrario, derivado do ``sso`` Bandeira de servizo. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renderes ``enable-login-with-password`` / ``disable-login-with-password`` En consecuencia (Non se necesita inxección JS - Penpot desactiva o contrasinal de forma nativa)Cando o login nativo está en, o papel bootstrap un contrasinal local para o usuario. ``administrator`` Perfil no backend PREPL (``enable-prepl-server``) En ``tasks/main.yml`` - ``create-profile`` Un perfil novo, ``update-profile`` Para configurar o contrasinal cando un login federado xa o creou; a correa de arranque é saltada baixo OIDC."

# libretranslate
msgid "**Native** local email/password login is *off* once OIDC is the login path (forces SSO), *on* otherwise — derived from the `sso` service flag. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` accordingly (no JS injection needed — Penpot disables the password form natively). When native login is on, the role bootstraps a local password for the `administrator` profile via the backend PREPL (`enable-prepl-server`) in `tasks/main.yml` — `create-profile` for a fresh profile, `update-profile` to set the password when a federated login already created it; the bootstrap is skipped under OIDC."
msgstr "**Nativos** Login de correo electrónico / contrasinal *Fóra* O IDC é o camiño de login (Forzas SSO), *Sobre* O contrario, derivado do `sso` Bandeira de servizo. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renderes `enable-login-with-password` / `disable-login-with-password` En consecuencia (Non se necesita inxección JS - Penpot desactiva o contrasinal de forma nativa)Cando o login nativo está en, o papel bootstrap un contrasinal local para o usuario. `administrator` Perfil no backend PREPL (`enable-prepl-server`) En `tasks/main.yml` - `create-profile` Un perfil novo, `update-profile` Para configurar o contrasinal cando un login federado xa o creou; a correa de arranque é saltada baixo OIDC."

