# libretranslate
msgid "**Required addons are explicit, and install failure is gated by `required`.** Every addon carries a boolean `required` field (default `false`). Core components that are part of the deployed app contract, such as Odoo's core modules, use `required: true`: they are always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, and MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. The field also governs install-failure behaviour: when an addon's installation fails, a `required: true` addon MUST hard-fail the play (the deploy stops), while a `required: false` addon MUST only emit a warning, skip that addon, and let the play continue."
msgstr "**Os complementos necesarios son explícitos e o fallo de instalación está regulado por `required`.** Cada addon leva un booleano. `required` Campo (Por defecto `false`). Compoñentes básicos que forman parte do contrato da aplicación despregada, como os módulos centrais de Odoo, usan `required: true`: Sempre está instalado, pode omitir `enabled`, e non se debe poñer `enabled: false`. O campo tamén regula o comportamento de fallo de instalación: cando falla a instalación dun complemento, un `required: true` Addon precisa perder o xogo (O despregamento para)Mentres a `required: false` addon Só debe emitir unha advertencia, saltar ese addon e deixar que o xogo continúe."

