msgid "**joomla local-login fallback spec** — `test-oidc-fallback.js:52` (the `?fallback=local` emergency hatch: local Joomla admin form login must reach the control panel). Root cause UNCONFIRMED. It is independent of the fixed OIDC-login spec: the fallback path short-circuits before the plugin's server-side discovery, so the committed `extra_hosts` fix does not cover it. The `secure => true` sticky-cookie hypothesis was rejected (`.onion` is a potentially-trustworthy origin and the e2e Firefox sets `dom.securecontext.allowlist_onions`, so Secure cookies are accepted over plain-http onion). Next step when it fails again post-fix: isolate the post-submit URL — Keycloak redirect (cookie lost) vs. form reject vs. slow control-panel render."
msgstr "**Joomla local-login fallback spec** - `test-oidc-fallback.js:52` (El `?fallback=local` Eclosion de emerxencia: o formulario local de Joomla ten que chegar ao panel de control.). Causa raíz incongruente. É independente da especificación fixa de login de OIDC: os curtocircuítos do camiño de retroceso antes do descubrimento do lado do servidor do plugin, polo que o engadido foi creado. `extra_hosts` A corrección non o cobre. El `secure => true` A hipótese sticky-cookie foi rexeitada. (`.onion` é unha orixe fiable e2Firefox Set `dom.securecontext.allowlist_onions`, Por iso, as cookies seguras son aceptadas sobre a onión http- plain.)O seguinte paso cando falla de novo post-fixo: illar o URL post-submito — redirección Keycloak (cookie perdida) vs. formulario de rexeitamento vs. slow control render."

