#, python-brace-format
msgid "All three personas (`guest`, `biber`, `administrator`) start at `${APP_BASE_URL}/` via direct goto (bookmark-style entry). The OAuth2-Proxy gate fires on the first request and redirects unauthenticated requests through Keycloak. No dashboard-tile click sits in the persona path."
msgstr "As tres persoas (`guest`, `biber`, `administrator`) Inicio » `${APP_BASE_URL}/` Vía: Direct goto (Entrada de estilo bookmark)El OAuth2-Proxy porta de lume na primeira solicitude e redirecciona solicitudes non validadas a través de Keycloak. Non hai un clic de control no camiño da persoa."

