msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "sondas de servizo cruzado (biber negado no prometeo, biber negado no matomo, capacidade de carga do panel) Non forma parte da persoa biber per-role. Viven no propio espectro do provedor. (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)parametrizado unha vez sobre o provedor `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesta. Para o panel, o escenario parametrizado delegados `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, que posúe a visibilidade de tella / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" Afirmacións pop-out nun espazo."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "As sondas de servizo cruzado non forman parte da personalidade do administrador. A capacidade de acceso de Dashboard é propiedade de `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, que delegue o corpo per-target ao `runDashboardCardScenario` Axuda en `dashboard-card-flow.js` (Tile visible → Click Loads in `#main iframe` → cabeceira \"Tab\" botón pop o embedido nunha pestana de navegador fresco). Ese axudante é o SPOT para a mecánica de dispositivos; as especificacións dos consumidores non deben repetir ningunha desas afirmacións. Prometheus admin-reach e chatarra paridade son propiedade de `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. A administración de Matomo e a presenza do tracker son propiedade de `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Cada provedor parametraliza a afirmación sobre a súa `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifesta."

# libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Declaracións superficiais de servizo transversal (A dispoñibilidade de tella do panel, prometeus admin-reach e paridade de chatarra, admin-reach e presenza de tracker, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) Son propiedade do propio provedor. Cada provedor parametraliza a afirmación sobre a súa `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifestado, por vía `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. As persoas consumidoras non deben duplicar estas sondas."

