#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Documentos a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out en `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. O papel mantense `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (Así, o contrato de intercambio de roles queda satisfeito) pero `roles_with_service('matomo')` que o solta de `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` O rastrexo do matomo e2e contrato. Reservado para ficheiro estático (Autoindex) e 301-Redirecta vhosts que non levan unha páxina HTML orientada a usuarios que pague a pena. `_paq` Tracker. O marcador acompaña `track:` Bandeira das honras de lookup."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Documentos a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out en `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. O papel mantense `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (Así, o contrato de intercambio de roles queda satisfeito) pero `roles_with_service('prometheus')` que o solta de `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reservado para 301Os vhosts só directamente que nunca realizan unha solicitude a través de prometeo de lua-resty, polo que non emiten ningunha. `app=\"<role>\"` Marcar e non ter ningún obxectivo. O marcador acompaña `scrape:` Bandeira das honras de lookup."

# libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Documentos a `unsafe-*: true` Bandeira en `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. Hai que empaparse con a `Reason:` Na mesma liña, o que rompe sen relaxación. `unsafe-inline` Remitir a execución en liña dunha XSS necesidades e `unsafe-eval` Re-admite string-to-code, polo que a bandeira debe ser verificada contra a aplicación en execución, non copiada doutro papel."

