# libretranslate
msgid "Run the role's deployed backup unit against the live data."
msgstr "Executar a unidade de copia de seguridade do rol contra os datos en directo."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential `backup-nfs-to-local` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (`rsync -a --delete`, with the shared `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copied in). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Executa o script; inicia a unidade de copia de seguridade do rol (Unha nova diferencia `backup-nfs-to-local` Xeración da exportación en directo), Despois, reflicte a instantánea no obxectivo (`rsync -a --delete`, con el compartido `<state>/backup` root protexido contra eliminación e nunca copiado en). `--no-safety-backup` Salta a unidade correr cando o obxectivo non ten nada que salvar."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume's mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Executa o script; inicia a unidade de copia de seguridade do rol (unha nova xeración de baudolo diferencial de cada volume e base de datos), resolve o punto de montaxe do volume e reflicte a instantánea nel. (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` Salta a unidade correr cando o obxectivo non ten nada que salvar."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (``rsync -a --delete``, with the shared ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copied in). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Executa o script; inicia a unidade de copia de seguridade do rol (Unha nova diferencia ``backup-nfs-to-local`` Xeración da exportación en directo), Despois, reflicte a instantánea no obxectivo (``rsync -a --delete``, con el compartido ``<state>/backup`` root protexido contra eliminación e nunca copiado en). ``--no-safety-backup`` Salta a unidade correr cando o obxectivo non ten nada que salvar."

# libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume’s mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Executa o script; inicia a unidade de copia de seguridade do rol (unha nova xeración de baudolo diferencial de cada volume e base de datos), resolve o punto de montaxe do volume e reflicte a instantánea nel (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` Salta a unidade correr cando o obxectivo non ten nada que salvar."

