msgid "Security: resolved all 80 open CodeQL/code-scanning alerts and added recurrence guards. Broke an unsafe import cycle in *cli/administration/deploy/development* via a leaf *env.py*; hardened *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (cookie prototype-pollution guard, log sanitisation, HTML-escaped exceptions, ReDoS-bounded handle regex) and *web-app-baserow* SSO open-redirect handling; required TLS ≥ 1.2 in network diagnose probes; validated *actionlint* tar members against path traversal; rewrote *decidim*/*apt-purge* regexes to avoid catastrophic backtracking; anchored six Playwright URL regexes and pinned *crs-k/stale-branches* to a SHA. Guards: an *import-linter* contract, a lint requiring justified bandit *noqa*, and ruff *BLE001* as a ratchet."
msgstr "Seguridade: todo resolto 80 Open CodeQL/code-scanning Alertas e gardas de recorrencia engadidas. Un ciclo de importación inseguro *cli/administration/deploy/development* A través dunha folla *env.py*; endurecido *web-app-bluesky* *server.js* (garda de contaminación de prototipos de cookie, sanitización de rexistros, excepcións capturadas en HTML, mango regex) e *web-app-baserow* SSO manexo directo aberto; TLS necesario ≥ 1.2 en redes de diagnóstico; validado *Acciónlint* Os membros do tar contra o traversal; rewrote *decidim*/*Apt-purge* Rexexes para evitar un trazado catastrófico; seis rexexes de URL de Playwright e pinned *crs-k/stale-branches* Unha sombra. Gardas: un *Importación-linter* Contrato, un forro que require bandido xustificado *Noqa*e ruff *BLE001* como un rato."

msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, which is only safe because the app port is bound to `127.0.0.1` and every request traverses the oauth2-proxy that overwrites `X-Forwarded-*`. The `X-Auth-Request-*` / `Remote-User` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through `web-svc-logout` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks' own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr ""

# libretranslate
msgid "Security: the identity headers are trusted unconditionally, which is only safe because the app port is bound to ``127.0.0.1`` and every request traverses the oauth2-proxy that overwrites ``X-Forwarded-*``. The ``X-Auth-Request-*`` / ``Remote-User`` variants are deliberately ignored so an already-authenticated client cannot inject a different identity. Logout must go through ``web-svc-logout`` / the oauth2-proxy sign-out, not Postmarks’ own logout link, because the proxy header re-establishes the session on the next request."
msgstr "Seguridade: os encabezados de identidade son fiables de forma incondicional, o que só é seguro porque o porto da aplicación está obrigado a ``127.0.0.1`` e todo o que queira facer un xuramento na terra,2Proxy que sobreescribir ``X-Forwarded-*``.El ``X-Auth-Request-*`` / ``Remote-User`` As variantes son deliberadamente ignoradas, polo que un cliente xa autenticado non pode inxectar unha identidade diferente. O logo debe pasar ``web-svc-logout`` El Oauth2Proxy sinal-out, non Postmarks<liquido de logout, porque a cabeceira proxy restablece a sesión na seguinte solicitude."

