# libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects `/` to the public `/discover` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only `/login` binds the SSO directive (see the note in [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js)). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga's SSO button. Taiga's AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local `test-login-oidc.js` and `test-login-native.js` specs, which enter at `/login` and log out through Taiga's own control."
msgstr "Taiga redirecciona `/` Para o público `/discover` escaparate, que fai unha ligazón de Login espida pero non o punto de entrada do OIDC; só `/login` Enlace á directiva SSO (Ver nota en [`files/playwright/_shared.js`](./files/playwright/_shared.js))As persoas compartidas sempre entran na raíz do sitio, para que nunca poidan chegar. Taigabotón SSO. A cuncha AngularJS de Taiga tamén expón logout só a través de `ng-click` / `tg-nav` / `ui-sref` As directivas, que non poden activar o asistente de logotipo xenérico. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Por tanto, declara `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; As viaxes equivalentes son conducidas polo rol local. `test-login-oidc.js` e `test-login-native.js` Espectros, que entran en `/login` e saír a través Taigapropio control."

# libretranslate
msgid "Taiga redirects ``/`` to the public ``/discover`` showcase, which renders a bare Login link but not the OIDC entry point; only ``/login`` binds the SSO directive (see the note in ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` and log out through Taiga’s own control."
msgstr "Taiga redirecciona ``/`` Para o público ``/discover`` escaparate, que fai unha ligazón de Login espida pero non o punto de entrada do OIDC; só ``/login`` Enlace á directiva SSO (Ver nota en ```files/playwright/_shared.js`` <./files/playwright/_shared.js>`__). The shared personas always enter at the site root, so they can never reach Taiga’s SSO button. Taiga’s AngularJS shell additionally exposes logout only through ``ng-click`` / ``tg-nav`` / ``ui-sref`` directives, which the generic in-app logout helper cannot activate. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the equivalent journeys are driven by the role-local ``test-login-oidc.js`` and ``test-login-native.js`` specs, which enter at ``/login`` e saír a través Taigapropio control."

