msgid "The Matrix role gains an ansible flavor (requirement 025) built on a unified compose template, with full Docker-in-Docker isolation, host-network mode cascaded to the addons and Jitsi, a central Postgres backend sharing the MATRIX_POSTGRES variables, and a central coturn aligned to the shared coturn variables for the MASH role. A dedicated MDAD runner image (python 3.13-slim with docker 28.0.4 CLI, migration validated against v2026.05.18.0) mounts the Infinito self-signed CA into both the runner and Synapse, and bootstrap now recovers cleanly from a stale marker."
msgstr "El Matrix Papel gaña un sabor ansible (Requisitos 025) Construído sobre un molde de composición unificado, co illamento de Docker-in-Docker completo, o modo de rede de hóspedes cascada aos addons e Jitsi, un backend central dos postgres compartindo o modelo de rede de aloxamento. MATRIX_POSTGRES Variables, e unha voltaxe central aliñada coas variables de cambio compartidos para o papel MASH. Imaxe do corredor MDAD (Python 3.13Baixar Docker 28.0.4 migración validada contra v2026.05.18.0) monta o Infinito auto-signado CA tanto para o corredor como para Synapse, e bootstrap agora recupera limpamente dun marcador de pé."

