msgstr "El `GitHub Actions self-hosted runner <https://docs.github.com/en/actions/hosting-your-own-runners/managing-self-hosted-runners/about-self-hosted-runners>`__ É un axente que executa traballos de fluxo de traballo en GitHub en vez de máquinas aloxadas en GitHub."

