msgstr "El ``INFINITO_DOMAIN`` Fallback declarado en ``default.env``."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``Options`` rule is what keeps a swarm host with NFS-backed volumes on the live copy (see `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): such a volume is a separate filesystem, so a snapshot of the data root would capture it as an empty directory and the backup would succeed while holding nothing. The declaration is checked rather than the mount table, because docker mounts those volumes lazily and unmounts them when the last container stops."
msgstr "El ``Options`` regra é o que mantén un anfitrión enxame con volumes apoiados por NFS na copia en directo. (Ver `NFS-backed volumes <#nfs-backed-volumes>`__): Este volume é un sistema de ficheiros separado, polo que unha instantánea da raíz de datos o capturaría como un directorio baleiro e a copia de seguridade tería éxito mentres non sostivese nada. A declaración compróbase en lugar da mesa de montaxe, porque o docker monta eses volumes lazosamente e non os monta cando o último recipiente para."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variable selects distro-specific package installation tasks (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux, or Fedora/EL). The role is designed to be driven by the ``make runner-ci-deploy`` target; see the end-to-end guide below."
msgstr "El ``RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION`` variable selecciona tarefas de instalación de paquetes específicos de distro (Debian, Ubuntu, Arch Linux ou Fedora/EL). O papel está deseñado para ser impulsado polo ``make runner-ci-deploy`` Mira o vídeo: Ver a guía de abaixo."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is **not** blocked: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ seeds a native OpenProject account whose password is the Keycloak administrator secret, so the journey runs in every variant. The ``biber`` persona is blocked only in the ``sso: false`` variants — OpenProject is seeded with the administrator alone, and ``biber`` is auto-provisioned exclusively through the oauth2-proxy trusted-header bridge onto the LDAP auth source, which those variants remove. Both flags are declared explicitly in `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."
msgstr "El ``administrator`` A persoa está **Non** bloqueado: `tasks/04_admin.yml <./tasks/04_admin.yml>`__ sementes autóctonas OpenProject conta cuxo contrasinal é Keycloak administrador secreto, polo que a viaxe funciona en cada variante. El ``biber`` A persoa só está bloqueada no ``sso: false`` Variantes - OpenProject só o administrador, e ``biber`` é autoprovisionado exclusivamente a través da auga2A ponte de cabeceira de confianza proxy sobre a fonte de auth LDAP, que esas variantes eliminan. Ambas as dúas bandeiras foron declaradas en `templates/playwright.env.j2 <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is additionally blocked because this role never creates a BookWyrm staff account. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` provisions proxied identities with ``create_user(...)`` and no ``is_staff`` flag, and no task promotes an existing account, so the administrator arrives as an ordinary member with no admin surface to exercise."
msgstr "El ``administrator`` A persoa está bloqueada porque este papel nunca crea un BookWyrm Conta de persoal. ``files/sso/header_auth.py`` a creación de identidades proxidas con ``create_user(...)`` E non ``is_staff`` Bandeira, e ningunha tarefa promove unha conta existente, polo que o administrador chega como un membro ordinario sen superficie de administración para exercer."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked because Decidim’s admin is a Devise account seeded by ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` and Devise signs in by e-mail address. The role’s Playwright env therefore exposes ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` and no ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, which is the variable the shared admin helper reads."
msgstr "El ``administrator`` Está bloqueado porque Decidimadmin é unha conta de Devise creada por ``files/ruby/ensure_admin_user.rb`` e enviar sinais por correo electrónico. A función Playwright env expón ``ADMIN_EMAIL`` E non ``ADMIN_USERNAME``, que é a variable que o administrador compartido le."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``administrator`` persona is blocked only while SSO is off. In that configuration ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` is false, so the trusted-header bridge is inactive and the sole account is the Django superuser bootstrapped by ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` via ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, whose identifier is the ORM ``username`` rather than the e-mail Baserow’s own sign-in form asks for. With SSO enabled the header bridge supplies the session and the persona runs."
msgstr "El ``administrator`` A persoa só está bloqueada mentres o SSO está fóra. Nesta configuración ``PROXY_HEADER_SSO`` é falso, polo que a ponte de cabeceira de confianza é inactiva e a única conta é a cabina de Django. ``tasks/01_manager_ops.yml`` Vía ``files/bootstrap_admin.py``, O seu identificador é o ORM ``username`` En lugar do correo electrónico BaserowA propia forma de inscrición pide. Con SSO, a ponte de cabeceira fornece a sesión e a persoa corre."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` and ``administrator`` Playwright personas are gated on ``services.sso.enabled``. When SSO is off, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. Two reasons:"
msgstr "El ``biber`` e ``administrator`` As persoas de Playwright están en ``services.sso.enabled``. Cando o SSO está fóra, ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ renders ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``Dous motivos:"

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``biber`` persona logs in through OIDC without trouble; what it cannot do is log out. Decidim’s sign-out is a ``data-method`` link inside the account dropdown, so the role’s own tests navigate to ``/users/sign_out`` directly rather than clicking a button the shared helper could find."
msgstr "El ``biber`` A persoa pasa por OIDC sen problemas; o que non pode facer é saír. A sinalización de Decidim é a ``data-method`` ligazón dentro da conta despregable, polo que as propias probas do papel navegan para ``/users/sign_out`` En lugar de premer un botón que o colaborador pode atopar."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``context_agent`` and ``contextagentmcp`` services in ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` context, read-only with every capability dropped, and it is the only MCP endpoint clients are given."
msgstr "El ``context_agent`` e ``contextagentmcp`` Servizos en ```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__ render only while ``mcp.enabled`` is true. The first runs ``ghcr.io/nextcloud/context_agent``, listens on its internal port for AppAPI only, and shares ``credentials.context_agent_app_secret`` with the ExApp registration as ``APP_SECRET``. The second is the adapter sidecar, built from the staged ``svc-ai-mcp-adapter`` contexto, só con todas as capacidades caídas, e é o único cliente de punta MCP."

# libretranslate
msgid "The ``dashboard`` service in ``meta/services.yml`` is only a consumer tile pointing at MIG’s canonical domain; it does not host MIG. The role’s contract is fully carried by the reachability, canonical-domain and content-type scenarios in ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, plus the guest persona. The path back to the generic personas is an authenticated MIG surface, which upstream does not have."
msgstr "El ``dashboard`` servizo en ``meta/services.yml`` é só un consumidor que apunta MIGO dominio canónico, que non alberga MIGO contrato do rol está completamente levado polos escenarios de alcance, dominio canónico e tipo de contido. ``files/playwright/playwright.spec.js``, Ademais da persoa invitada. O camiño de volta ás persoas xenéricas é un autenticado. MIG superficie que non ten."

