msgstr "El `test-workspace` etapa executa o fluxo de traballo do espazo de traballo listado na `Infrastructure tests` Mesa de [workflows.md](../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The `test` job runs [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml): `make test` fans the unit, integration, lint and external suites out in parallel on the runner host. It MUST pass `code-quality-gate`."
msgstr "El `test` Traballo corre [call-test.yml](../../../../.github/workflows/call-test.yml):: `make test` fans da unidade, integración, linte e suites externas para fóra en paralelo no anfitrión corredor. Debe pasar `code-quality-gate`."

