# libretranslate
msgid "The administrator is provisioned as an `XWiki.XWikiUsers` object without a `password` property (see [`templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`](./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2)), and every privileged operation of the role authenticates as the built-in `superadmin` with `credentials.superadminpassword`. Neither credential is the Keycloak secret the shared persona helpers submit, and `biber` has no XWiki user page at all — only the administrator page is created ([`tasks/03_administrator.yml`](./tasks/03_administrator.yml)) — while the OIDC group mapping stays commented out in [`templates/xwiki.properties.j2`](./templates/xwiki.properties.j2). [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The Keycloak coupling is instead proven through XWiki's own login action by the addon spec [`files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`](./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js)."
msgstr "O administrador está configurado como un `XWiki.XWikiUsers` obxecto sen a `password` Propiedade (Ver [`templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`](./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2))Todas as operacións privilexiadas do papel auténtanse como o incorporado. `superadmin` Con `credentials.superadminpassword`. Ningunha credencial é Keycloak que a xente que axuda, e `biber` non ten XWiki Páxina de usuario: só se crea a páxina de administrador ([`tasks/03_administrator.yml`](./tasks/03_administrator.yml)) - mentres que o grupo OIDC permanece comentado en [`templates/xwiki.properties.j2`](./templates/xwiki.properties.j2). [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Por tanto, declara `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`.El Keycloak O acoplamento está probado a través XWiki' acción de login por addon spec' [`files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`](./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The administrator is provisioned as an ``XWiki.XWikiUsers`` object without a ``password`` property (see ```templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2`` <./templates/xml/user/xwikiusers_object.xml.j2>`__), and every privileged operation of the role authenticates as the built-in ``superadmin`` with ``credentials.superadminpassword``. Neither credential is the Keycloak secret the shared persona helpers submit, and ``biber`` has no XWiki user page at all — only the administrator page is created (```tasks/03_administrator.yml`` <./tasks/03_administrator.yml>`__) — while the OIDC group mapping stays commented out in ```templates/xwiki.properties.j2`` <./templates/xwiki.properties.j2>`__. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``. The Keycloak coupling is instead proven through XWiki’s own login action by the addon spec ```files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js`` <./files/playwright/addons/oidc-authenticator.spec.js>`__."
