msgid "The consumer role asserts only that the matomo tracking snippet is in the HTML and that navigation generates the expected `/matomo.php` request (covered by `assertCspInjections` in the persona-helper). Matomo admin-reach, biber denial, and per-consumer tracker-site registration live in `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` only."
msgstr "O papel do consumidor afirma só que o fragmento de seguimento do matomo está no HTML e que a navegación xera o esperado. `/matomo.php` Solicitude (cuberto por `assertCspInjections` En persoa-axudante). Matomo admin-reach, denegación de bíbero e rexistro de tracker por consumidor vivo `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Só."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer role's spec does NOT exercise the dashboard tile. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` parameterises one tile-reachability test per consumer over `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and delegates the body to `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` from the sibling `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (tile visibility, click → `#main iframe` embed, header \"Tab\" button → new browser tab). Consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any tile / iframe / tab assertions."
msgstr "O espectro do papel do consumidor non exerce o panel de control. `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Parametriza unha proba de eficiencia por consumidor sobre `DASHBOARD_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` delegar o corpo en `runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)` desde o irmán `dashboard-card-flow.js` SPOT (Visibilidade, click → `#main iframe` embutido, header \"Tab\" Botón → Nova pestana do navegador).Os espectros de consumo non deben reimplementar ningunha afirmación de nivel / iframe / tabela."

# libretranslate
msgid "The consumer's ``services.<engine>`` block (or empty)."
msgstr "O consumidor ``services.<engine>`` Bloque (ou baleiro)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The container name and DNS alias within the `central_mariadb` network. Used by other services (like Moodle) to connect."
msgstr "Nome do contedor e alias DNS dentro do `central_mariadb` Rede. Usado por outros servizos (como Moodle) para conectar."

# libretranslate
msgid "The control databases are dropped: they exist in every cluster and are not deployed as applications, so nothing consumes them."
msgstr "As bases de datos de control son retiradas: existen en cada clúster e non se despregan como aplicacións, polo que nada as consome."

# libretranslate
msgid "The correct Pull Request template MUST be used."
msgstr "Debe usarse o modelo de solicitude de Pull."

# libretranslate
msgid "The counterpart to :mod:`yaml_io`, which reads values. Everything here keeps comments, quoting and vault tags intact, because host_vars is hand-edited as often as it is generated."
msgstr "A contraparte de :mod:`yaml_io`, que le valores. Todo aquí mantén os comentarios, citas e etiquetas de bóveda intactas, porque host_vars É editado a man con tanta frecuencia como se xera."

# libretranslate
msgid "The credential **runtime values** (nested keys, e.g. `recaptcha.key`, `recaptcha.secret`)."
msgstr "A credencial **Valores de tempo real** (As claves, por exemplo. `recaptcha.key`, `recaptcha.secret`)."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The credential **schema definitions** (flat keys, e.g. `alerting_telegram_bot_token: { description, algorithm, validation }`)."
msgstr "A credencial **Definicións de esquema** (Chaves, por exemplo. `alerting_telegram_bot_token: { description, algorithm, validation }`)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The credential generator participates in this overlay so the providers a variant enables receive their schema-defined credentials in the inventory before deploy time. See [Credentials Generation](../../../design/variants.md#credentials-generation-) in the design doc for the full CI/CD vs standalone flow and the involved CLI flags."
msgstr "O xerador de credenciais participa nesta superposición de xeito que os provedores unha variante permite recibir as súas credenciais definidas polo esquema no inventario antes de enviar o tempo. Ver [Xeración credenciais](../../../design/variants.md#credentials-generation-) no doc de deseño para o fluxo total de CI / CD vs standalone e as bandeiras de CLI implicadas."

# libretranslate
msgid "The credentials an application block declares, empty when it declares none. Reading a malformed ``secrets`` raises rather than resolving empty."
msgstr "As credenciais dun bloque de aplicacións declaran baleiro cando non declara ningunha. Ler unha malformada ``secrets`` Levanta en lugar de baleirar."

# libretranslate
msgid "The current `roles/web-app-matrix/` ships a self-contained compose stack with Synapse, Element, a handful of bridges and a ChatGPT bot. Adding a new bridge or service today means hand-rolling its compose service, env file, postgres seed, well-known entries and Playwright coverage inside this repo — the marginal cost per bridge is high, and the matrix-docker-ansible-deploy (MDAD) upstream community already maintains all of that under one umbrella role."
msgstr "A actual `roles/web-app-matrix/` Embarca unha pila de composición autónoma con Synapse, Element, un puñado de pontes e un bot ChatGPT. Engadindo unha nova ponte ou servizo hoxe en día significa o rexistro a man do seu servizo de composición, arquivo env, sementes de postgres, entradas ben coñecidas e cobertura de Playwright dentro deste repositorio — o custo marxinal por ponte é alto, ea matriz-docker-ansible-deploy. (MDAD) A comunidade de upstream xa mantén todo iso baixo un único rol paraugas."

# libretranslate
msgid "The current statement that Flowise lacks an instance-level registry is incorrect for the pinned version and MUST be removed from requirement 025 and the role README. The deployment MUST use the authenticated `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` routes with a scoped API identity whose workspace permissions are limited to the required `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update`, and `tools:delete` operations."
msgstr "A afirmación actual que Flowise Falta de rexistro a nivel de instancia é incorrecto para a versión marcada e debe ser eliminado do requisito. 025 O papel da lectura. A instalación debe utilizar o autenticado `/api/v1/custom-mcp-servers` Rutas con alcance API Identidade cuxos permisos de espazo de traballo están limitados ao requirido. `tools:create`, `tools:view`, `tools:update`, e `tools:delete` operacións."

# libretranslate
msgid "The dashboard sits behind proxy + Keycloak OIDC (Decision #9); voice/chat connectors are the follow-up (Decision #10)."
msgstr "O panel está detrás do proxy + Keycloak OIDC (Decisión #9); Os conectores de voz/chat son os seguintes: (Decisión #10)."

# libretranslate
