# libretranslate
msgid "The flag is mandatory, enforced by [test_onion_port_flag.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_onion_port_flag.py): every category declared under `local` or `public` needs a `true` or a `false`, and every `false` needs `# nocheck: onion-flag` plus the reason it is false. Four groups are settled centrally instead and take no flag: the categories a hidden service cannot carry (`relay`, `media`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`), the proxy-fronted `http`, `sso` and `websocket`, the implicit-TLS variants (`smtps`, `imaps`, `pop3s`, `ldaps`), and any entity that already answers the question through `exposed:`."
msgstr "A bandeira é obrigatoria por [test_onion_port_flag.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_onion_port_flag.py): Cada categoría declarada en `local` ou `public` Necesita a `true` Ou a `false`, e cada `false` Necesidades `# nocheck: onion-flag` A razón pola que é falso. Os catro grupos establecéronse centralmente e non levan bandeira: as categorías que un servizo oculto non pode levar a cabo. (`relay`, `media`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`)Diante do proxy `http`, `sso` e `websocket`, As variantes implicit-TLS (`smtps`, `imaps`, `pop3s`, `ldaps`)calquera persoa que xa responda a pregunta `exposed:`."

# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The flavor enum is ``{oidc, oauth2, saml}`` with ``oidc`` as the default when omitted. The ``is_proxy_gated`` predicate is the one place that encodes \"the oauth2-proxy sidecar fronts this role\" — every other layer MUST consult this helper instead of re-implementing the ``enabled AND flavor == 'oauth2'`` compound. The ``oauth2_*`` keys expose the gated upstream config so call sites resolve cross-role data through one named property rather than a literal ``lookup('config', app_id, 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` (which would otherwise trip the literal-protocol-lookup and lookup-config-path static-scan guards)."
msgstr "O sabor enum é ``{oidc, oauth2, saml}`` Con ``oidc`` como se omitise. El ``is_proxy_gated`` predicado é o único sitio que codifica \"El Oauth2Proxy sidecar fronte a este papel\" Calquera outra capa debe consultar esta axuda en vez de completar o ``enabled AND flavor == 'oauth2'`` composto. El ``oauth2_*`` As claves expoñen a configuración corrente arriba regulada, polo que os sitios de chamadas resolven os datos cruzados a través dunha propiedade chamada en vez dun literal. ``lookup('config', app_id, 'services.sso.oauth2.<sub>')`` (que doutro xeito faría a viaxe literal-protocol-lookup e lookup-config-path gardas estática-scan)."

# libretranslate
msgid "The fleet is deployed on **every** cluster node, but not as a ``docker stack`` service (``workload: node-local`` in ``meta/services.yml``): each runner needs the docker socket and the registered identity of exactly its node. The image is built once on the manager and distributed through the registry dependency (``svc-registry-docker``), the only part that runs as a swarm service."
msgstr "A flota está en **cada** O nodo, pero non como un ``docker stack`` servizo (``workload: node-local`` En ``meta/services.yml``): Cada corredor necesita a socket docker e a identidade rexistrada do nodo. A imaxe constrúese unha vez no xestor e distribúese a través da dependencia do rexistro. (``svc-registry-docker``)A única parte que funciona como servizo de enxame."

