# libretranslate
msgid "The generic playwright biber and administrator personas are blocked via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Rule 11 explicit opt-out). Bluesky's social-app is a mobile-first SPA whose logout / account control sits behind a profile menu the auth-surface check cannot reach. The bespoke \"OIDC: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky session into social-app via Keycloak (variant A+)\" test and its LDAP-variant counterpart in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` already verify both personas authenticate correctly (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt is present after the broker handoff). Once a stable selector for the social-app profile menu lands upstream, drop the opt-outs and let the persona helpers drive the dashboard → app → logout journey end-to-end."
msgstr "Os biberóns de dereitos de autor xenéricos e as persoas administradoras son bloqueados a través de `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` En `templates/playwright.env.j2` (req 019 Regra 11 Opción explícita). A aplicación social de Bluesky é unha SPA móbil cuxo control de logotipo / conta está detrás dun menú de perfil que a comprobación de superficie non pode alcanzar. O Bespoke \"Categoría: oauth2-proxy + login-broker drop a Bluesky Aplicación social vía Keycloak (variante A+)\" proba e a súa contraparte de variantes LDAP `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Comprobar que as dúas persoas se autentican correctamente (BSKY_STORAGE.accessJwt Está presente despois do Broker)Unha vez que un selector estable para o menú de perfil social-app cae augas arriba, solta os opt-outs e deixa que a persoa axudantes dirixir o panel → app → viaxe de logout final-end."

