msgid "The pins are parsed by hand instead of through ``utils.cache.yaml`` because every ``lint-*`` target depends on ``install-lint``, which bootstraps the toolchain on a bare interpreter -- PyYAML is not installed yet at that point, and importing it here fails the whole lint stage with ``ModuleNotFoundError``. ``_parse_pins`` therefore only understands the two-level shape this one file uses; ``tests/unit/python/utils/install/lint/test_pinned_versions.py`` cross-checks it against PyYAML so the two readings cannot drift apart."
msgstr "As pinzas están feitas a man en vez de a través ``utils.cache.yaml`` Porque cada ``lint-*`` O obxectivo depende de ``install-lint``, que atrapa a cadea de ferramentas nun intérprete espido - PyYAML aínda non está instalado nese punto, e importalo aquí falla toda a etapa de forro con todo. ``ModuleNotFoundError``. ``_parse_pins`` Polo tanto, só entende a forma de dous niveis que usa este ficheiro. ``tests/unit/python/utils/install/lint/test_pinned_versions.py`` cross-checks en contra de PyYAML para que as dúas lecturas non poden derivar."

# libretranslate
