# libretranslate
msgid "The reason is the endpoint's own shape: Baserow's `MCPEndpoint` carries no scope column, so the endpoint key grants every tool the backend implements — including the three write tools — with no way to narrow it. The adapter is what narrows it, by serving four read tools and refusing every other name."
msgstr "A razón é a forma do punto final: a de Baserow. `MCPEndpoint` Non leva columna de alcance, polo que a clave de punto final concede cada ferramenta que implemente o backend, incluíndo as tres ferramentas de escritura, sen xeito de reducila. O adaptador é o que o restrinxe, ao servir catro ferramentas de lectura e rexeitar calquera outro nome."

