msgid "The reconciliation stage MUST run before the end-to-end tests that read the converged state, and MUST NOT sit behind a task that a red test aborts. Placed in the destructor stage it ran after the Playwright suite, and `any_errors_fatal` meant any failing role skipped reconciliation entirely, so the suite asserted a state nothing had produced yet."
msgstr "A fase de reconciliación debe executarse antes das probas finais que len o estado converxente, e non debe sentarse detrás dunha tarefa que aborta unha proba vermella. Colocado no escenario de Destrutor que funcionou despois da suite Playwright, e `any_errors_fatal` Todo o papel que fallaba era reconciliación por completo, polo que a suite afirmou que un estado aínda non producira nada."

