# libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. As soon as an IAM source is wired, the role sets `GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION` (`templates/env.j2`, driven by `GITEA_IAM_ENABLED` in `vars/main.yml`), and `tasks/setup/oidc.yml` registers only the auth source — never a Gitea user — so a Keycloak identity without a pre-linked Gitea account is bounced back to `/user/login`. The opt-out lapses once the deploy provisions (or auto-links) Gitea accounts for the persona identities."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` e `administrator` As viaxes persoais optan por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Tan pronto como unha fonte IAM está conectada, o rol establece `GITEA__service__DISABLE_REGISTRATION` (`templates/env.j2`, impulsado por `GITEA_IAM_ENABLED` En `vars/main.yml`), e `tasks/setup/oidc.yml` Só se rexistra a fonte de auga - nunca a Gitea Usuario:A Keycloak Identidade sen conexión previa Gitea O conto volve a `/user/login`. O opt-out voltas unha vez que as disposicións de implantación (ou autolinks) Gitea conta as identidades das persoas."

# libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Fider's SSO entry is a two-step modal: the header \"Sign in\" button only opens the provider dialog, and a second click on \"Continue with … SSO\" performs the Keycloak redirect, whereas the shared helper clicks exactly once and never reaches the IdP. Both journeys are covered end-to-end by this role's own `fider: admin sso login` and `fider: biber sso login as regular user` scenarios in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`; the opt-out lapses once the shared helper learns Fider's modal."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` e `administrator` As viaxes persoais optan por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. A entrada SSO de Fider é un modal de dous pasos: a cabeceira \"Signo en\" botón só abre o diálogo do provedor e un segundo clic sobre \"Continúa con ... SSO\" Realiza o Keycloak redireccionar, mentres que o axudante compartido fai clic exactamente unha vez e nunca chega ao IdP. Ambas as dúas viaxes están cubertas polo propio papel. `fider: admin sso login` e `fider: biber sso login as regular user` Escenarios en `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`; o opt-out voltas unha vez que o colaborador aprende FiderO modal."

# libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Flowise has no in-app OIDC adapter: SSO is an oauth2-proxy sidecar (`services.sso.flavor: oauth2`), and behind that gate Flowise still presents its own sign-in form for the single instance account seeded from `FLOWISE_USERNAME` / `FLOWISE_PASSWORD` in `templates/env.j2`. `biber` has no Flowise identity at all, and the shared helpers only drive Keycloak forms while `services.sso` is enabled, so neither persona can reach an authenticated Flowise surface; the OIDC gate itself is covered by `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` e `administrator` As viaxes persoais optan por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Flowise non ten adaptador OIDC in-app: SSO é un autómata.2Proxy sidecar (`services.sso.flavor: oauth2`), e detrás desta porta Flowise aínda presenta a súa propia forma de inscrición para a conta de instancia única con `FLOWISE_USERNAME` / `FLOWISE_PASSWORD` En `templates/env.j2`. `biber` non ten Flowise A identidade e os axudantes compartidos só conduciron Keycloak formas mentres `services.sso` Está habilitado para que ningunha persoa poida chegar a un documento autenticado. Flowise superficie; a propia porta do OIDC está cuberta por `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`."

# libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Joomla's site template ships no login/logout module, and `plg_system_keycloak` exposes sign-out only as the route `index.php?option=keycloak&task=logout` (`files/joomla-oidc-plugin/plg_system_keycloak/src/Extension/Keycloak.php`, `handleLogout`) rather than as a rendered control, so the persona's mandatory in-app logout click has no target and navigating a logout URL directly is forbidden by the contract. The OIDC handshake itself, the LDAP variant and the `/administrator?fallback=local` hatch are covered by `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`, `test-ldap-login.js` and `test-oidc-fallback.js`."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` e `administrator` As viaxes persoais optan por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Joomla's site template ships no login/logout Módulo `plg_system_keycloak` Expón o sinal só como a ruta `index.php?option=keycloak&task=logout` (`files/joomla-oidc-plugin/plg_system_keycloak/src/Extension/Keycloak.php`, `handleLogout`) En vez de como un control renderizado, polo que o clic de logotipo de in-app obrigatorio da persoa non ten obxectivo e navegar por unha URL de logotipo está directamente prohibido polo contrato. A versión OIDC, a variante LDAP e `/administrator?fallback=local` eclosion está cuberta por `files/playwright/test-oidc-login.js`, `test-ldap-login.js` e `test-oidc-fallback.js`."

# libretranslate
#, no-python-format, python-brace-format
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. Outside the OIDC variant, `templates/casc.yaml.j2` selects the `ldap` or `local` security realm and Jenkins' only login surface is its own Java-realm form, whose fields are named `j_username` / `j_password` (pinned by the LDAP scenario in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`) — names the shared native-login probe does not match, so the persona never authenticates. The flag is currently unconditional; narrowing it to `{% if not JENKINS_OIDC_ENABLED %}` once the OIDC persona journey has been verified end-to-end is the path back."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` e `administrator` As viaxes persoais optan por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. fóra da variante OIDC, `templates/casc.yaml.j2` Selecciona o `ldap` ou `local` seguridade e JenkinsA única superficie de login é a súa JavaForma real, cuxos campos se chaman `j_username` / `j_password` (O caso de LDAP é `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`) Os nomes da sonda nativa compartida non coinciden, polo que a persoa nunca se autentica. A bandeira é actualmente incondicional, reducindo `{% if not JENKINS_OIDC_ENABLED %}` Unha vez verificado o camiño de volta a persoa OIDC é o camiño."

# libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. The oauth2-proxy sidecar only gates the vhost — FusionDirectory keeps its own LDAP-bind login behind it, which the role's OIDC scenario in `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` asserts by expecting a \"Sign in\" button to still be visible after the Keycloak round-trip. `tasks/main.yml` provisions no FusionDirectory account, so the Keycloak identity maps to no directory session the shared helpers could carry through to an in-app logout."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` e `administrator` As viaxes persoais optan por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. El Oauth2Sidecar proxy só porta o vhost FusionDirectory mantén o seu propio login-bind de LDAP detrás del, que o escenario OIDC do papel `files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` Afirmando a \"Signo en\" botón para ser visible despois do Keycloak round-trip. `tasks/main.yml` Disposicións no FusionDirectory conta, así que Keycloak Mapas de identidade sen sesión de directorios que os axudantes compartidos poderían pasar a un logout in-app."

# libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` and `administrator` persona journeys are opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. web-app-hugo serves a statically built site: `services.sso` is hard-disabled in `meta/services.yml`, the container is a Hugo build baked into nginx (`templates/compose.yml.j2`), and the Playwright env file renders no `ADMIN_*` / `BIBER_*` credentials. There is no session, no admin surface and no logout control to drive, so the `guest` persona plus the reachability, CSP and rendered-HTML assertions are the complete contract for this role."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` e `administrator` As viaxes persoais optan por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` / `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. web-app-hugo Este é un sitio web estático: `services.sso` É difícil de desmontar en `meta/services.yml`, O contido é a Hugo Creando Nginx (`templates/compose.yml.j2`), e o ficheiro env Playwright non dá `ADMIN_*` / `BIBER_*` credenciais. Non hai sesión, non hai superficie de administración e ningún control de logouts para conducir. `guest` A persoa máis a dispoñibilidade, as afirmacións de CSP e render-HTML son o contrato completo para este papel."

# libretranslate
msgid "The shared `biber` persona journey is opted out via `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` in `templates/playwright.env.j2`. A Jellyfin account binds to exactly one authentication provider, so biber's login is owned by the per-addon specs that know which provider is live: `files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js` for OIDC and `addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js` for the LDAP-only matrix variant. The generic persona cannot pick between them and would duplicate or contradict that coverage; `playwright.spec.js` keeps the `guest` scenario and the native administrator login."
msgstr "O compartido `biber` A viaxe a persoa é optada por `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED` En `templates/playwright.env.j2`. A. Jellyfin A conta únese a exactamente un fornecedor de autenticación, polo que o login de Biber é propiedade das especificacións de per-addon que saben que provedor está vivo: `files/playwright/addons/sso-authentication.spec.js` para o IDC e `addons/ldap-authentication.spec.js` variante de matriz só LDAP. A persoa xenérica non pode elixir entre eles e pode duplicar ou contradicir esa cobertura. `playwright.spec.js` mantén o `guest` Creación e login do administrador nativo."

