# libretranslate
msgid "The systemd services installed by `svc.sh` require a host with a real init system. Registration, service install, and service start are skipped when `DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER=true`; the role can be fully deployed in DinD (binary extraction and `.env` file work). The nested `deploy-fresh-purged-apps` call in `test.sh` is also skipped when `DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER=true` — in DinD, `make up` does not start the package-cache proxy (`cache_stack_enabled()` returns false in CI), so apt inside the fresh container cannot resolve the proxy hostname and package installs fail. Structural checks (binary + `.env`) are sufficient proof of a correct deploy in DinD; the full end-to-end deploy only runs on a real host."
msgstr "Servizos instalados por `svc.sh` Necesita un servidor cun sistema de init real. O rexistro, a instalación do servizo e o inicio do servizo son omitidos cando `DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER=true`; O papel pode ser completamente despregado en DD (extracción binaria e `.env` Ficheiro Traballo). A aniña `deploy-fresh-purged-apps` Chamada en `test.sh` Tamén se usa cando `DOCKER_IN_CONTAINER=true` En Dind, `make up` Inicia o proxy de caixa (`cache_stack_enabled()` Devolve falsos), polo tanto, apt dentro do contedor fresco non pode resolver o nome do servidor proxy e instalar paquetes falla. Verificacións estruturais (binario + `.env`) Son suficientes probas dun despregamento correcto en DinD; o despregamento completo do extremo a extremo só se executa nun hóspede real."

