msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. `stable`) in a detached HEAD state."
msgstr "Esta función permite a **robusto, reutilizable Git pull utilitario** Automatización do sistema. Realiza clons pouco profundos ou actualizacións de Git repositorios e opcionalmente **Pon a árbore de traballo a unha etiqueta específica** (e.g. `stable`) en un estado cerrado."

# libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role provides a **robust, reusable Git pull utility** for system automation. It performs shallow clones or updates of Git repositories and optionally **pins the working tree to a specific tag** (e.g. ``stable``) in a detached HEAD state."
