# libretranslate
msgid "This role declares no addons (it ships no ``meta/addons/`` directory). Mattermost **Team Edition** manages plugin install and enablement at runtime; there is no declarative per-plugin install path in this role. Plugins are operator-managed. The named volumes ``plugins`` and ``client-plugins`` declared in ``meta/volumes.yml`` are node-local derived copies that every replica extracts for itself from the image’s prepackaged bundles; an uploaded bundle persists in the file store, not in them. No addon bridges any in-repo service."
msgstr "Esta función non declara complementos (que navegou no ``meta/addons/`` directorio)...matemática **Team Edition** xestione a instalación e habilitación de plugins en tempo de execución; non hai un camiño de instalación por-plugin declarativo neste papel. Os plugins son xestionados por operadores. Os chamados volumes ``plugins`` e ``client-plugins`` Declarado en ``meta/volumes.yml`` Son copias derivadas de nodo-local que cada réplica extrae para si dos paquetes preempaquetados da imaxe; un paquete cargado persiste na tenda de arquivos, non nelas. Ningún addon ponte ningún servizo."

