# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "Esta función desprega **Shopware 6** Usando **Docker**automatiza a instalación, migración e configuración da túa tenda, integrando cun centro **MariaDB** Base de datos. compoñentes opcionais como **Redis** e **OpenSearch** mellorar as capacidades de busca e rendemento, mentres que **OIDC** integrar a administración con **Keycloak**As contas de directorio inscríbense do mesmo xeito: Tendaware non ten extensión admin-LDAP este papel pode instalar, polo que as identidades LDAP chegan a través KeycloakA federación de usuarios en lugar de a través dun plugin propio."

