# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys GitLab from the official Cloud Native GitLab (CNG) CE images at ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` as separate services: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (sole HTTP entry point), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) and a one-shot ``migrations`` job. All images share a single version pin (``services.webservice.version``). PostgreSQL, Redis and S3-compatible object storage are wired through the platform lookups (central or sidecar), OIDC and SMTP through the platform SSO and email services. The front proxy terminates TLS and forwards HTTP to workhorse."
msgstr "Esta función desprega GitLab Nativo oficial da nube GitLab (CNG) As imaxes en ``registry.gitlab.com/gitlab-org/build/cng/`` Servizos separados: ``webservice`` (puma), ``sidekiq``, ``workhorse`` (Punto de entrada HTTP), ``gitaly``, ``shell`` (gitlab-sshd) Un único disparo ``migrations`` emprego. Todas as imaxes comparten un único pin (``services.webservice.version``)PostgreSQL, Redis En S3O almacenamento de obxectos compatibles acádanse a través dos lookups da plataforma. (Centro ou sidecar)OIDC e SMTP a través da plataforma SSO e servizos de correo electrónico. O proxy frontal remata TLS e reenvía HTTP para traballar."

# libretranslate
