# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Jenkins on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Jenkins image that pre-installs the ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, and ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, then mounts a JCasC YAML file that wires the security realm against Keycloak (variant 0, OIDC) or ``svc-db-openldap`` (variant 1, LDAP). The setup wizard is skipped via ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` so the JCasC config takes over from first boot."
msgstr "Esta función desprega Jenkins Sobre Docker ComposeCrea un costume Jenkins imaxe que preinstala o ``oic-auth``, ``ldap``, ``role-strategy``, e ``configuration-as-code`` plugins, entón monta un ficheiro JCasC YAML que arame o reino de seguridade contra Keycloak (variantes 0, OIDC) ou ``svc-db-openldap`` (variantes 1, LDAP)O mago está afundido a través ``JAVA_OPTS=-Djenkins.install.runSetupWizard=false`` Así, a configuración JCasC toma o control da primeira bota."

# libretranslate
