# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role's database, and installs the in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla's core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
msgstr "Esta función desprega Joomla Sobre Docker ComposeCrea un costume Joomla imaxe que frea en Compositor para extensións de tempo de execución, executa a Joomla instalador de CLI coa base de datos do rol, e instala o in-role `plg_system_keycloak` plugin para que o sitio web fale contra OIDC Keycloak Mapa do grupo RBAC. Unha variante de matriz deploy cambia o papel a LDAP Joomlaplugin de autenticación LDAP."

# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Joomla on Docker Compose. It builds a custom Joomla image that bakes in Composer for runtime extension builds, runs the Joomla CLI installer with the role’s database, and installs the in-role ``plg_system_keycloak`` plugin so the site speaks OIDC against Keycloak with RBAC group mapping. A matrix-deploy variant flips the role to LDAP via Joomla’s core LDAP authentication plugin instead."
