# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys KIX as an Infinito.Nexus web app behind the project's standard `sys-stk-front-proxy` and `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar chain. The upstream `kix-on-premise` proxy, backend, and frontend containers ship from `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. The backend initialises its schema (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) against the central `svc-db-postgres` cluster, or against the embedded postgres sidecar when no central provider is in the inventory, with `pg_trgm` pre-activated via `services.postgres.extensions`; the cache is the role-local passwordless redis sidecar (the frontend ignores `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`). Initial admin credentials are seeded via `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` on first start (see `meta/secrets.yml`)."
msgstr "Esta función desprega KIX Como un Infinito.Nexus Aplicación web detrás do estándar do proxecto `sys-stk-front-proxy` e `web-app-keycloak`Cadea lateral SSO-proxy. Baixar Upstream `kix-on-premise` Barco de contedores proxy, backend e frontend `docker-registry.kixdesk.com/public/`. O backend inicializa o seu esquema (`scripts/database/kix-schema.xml`) Contra o central `svc-db-postgres` cluster, ou contra o sidecar postgres incrustado cando ningún provedor central está no inventario, con `pg_trgm` Activado vía `services.postgres.extensions`; A caché é o redis sidecar sen contrasinal local (A frontenda ignora `REDIS_CACHE_PASSWORD`)As credenciais de administración inicial son sementadas a través `INITIAL_ADMIN_PW` No primeiro comezo (Ver `meta/secrets.yml`)."

# libretranslate
