# libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys a self-hosted Bluesky stack on Docker Compose. It runs the official PDS container as the user-data layer, builds the upstream `@bluesky-social/social-app` web client as the user-facing UI, and adds an in-role login-broker sidecar that gates the web client through Keycloak via `web-app-keycloak`'s SSO-proxy sidecar. The broker auto-provisions PDS accounts for incoming OIDC users, holds the synthesised app-password AES-256-GCM-encrypted in a process-local cache, and drops a usable PDS session into the social-app's local storage so end users never see the synthesised credential."
msgstr "Esta función desprega un autosuficiente Bluesky Empilha en Docker ComposeFunciona o contedor PDS oficial como a capa de datos do usuario, constrúe o upstream. `@bluesky-social/social-app` cliente web como UI orientado polo usuario, e engade un sidecar login-broker in-role que portas o cliente web a través Keycloak Vía `web-app-keycloak`Sidecar SSO-proxy. O corrector auto-provisiones PDS contas para os usuarios entrantes do IDC, ten a app-password AES-256-GCM cifrada nunha caché local de proceso, emite unha sesión PDS utilizable no almacenamento local da aplicación social para que os usuarios finais nunca vexan a credencial sintetizada."

# libretranslate
