msgid "Walk a (possibly nested) credentials schema and emit one vault block per scalar leaf into ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) recurse into nested CommentedMaps so each leaf becomes its own vault-encrypted entry instead of being collapsed via ``str(dict)`` into a Python-repr blob (the regression that broke run 26428080957 jobs 77797371397 and 77797371442 for web-app-espocrm and web-app-listmonk)."
msgstr "Camiñar a (posiblemente aniñada) Credenciais esquema e emiten un bloque de bóveda por folla escalar ``dest_node``. Nested dicts (e.g. ``secrets.credentials.recaptcha = {key, secret}``) Repítense en CommentedMaps aniñadas polo que cada folla convértese na súa propia entrada cifrada en bóvedas en vez de ser colapsada por medio de ``str(dict)`` Comentarios en Python-repr blob (A regresión que se rompe 26428080957 Emprego 77797371397 e 77797371442 Para web-app-espocrm e web-app-listmonk)."

