# libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is deployed, the node’s ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` is the minted ``.onion`` address, so the whole stack (web vhosts, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) resolves onion domains consistently. The Tor daemon runs as a host-network compose sidecar and maps one hidden service to the host OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``); per-app subdomains (``<app>.<node>.onion``) are routed by the ``Host`` header. TLS is off on the onion side (onion v3 already provides transport encryption + server authentication); apps still receive ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` because ``.onion`` is a browser Secure Context."
msgstr "Cando ``svc-net-tor`` está despregada, o nodo ``DOMAIN_PRIMARY`` É o mineiro ``.onion`` dirección, así que toda a pila (Webtalk, Keycloak SSO, LDAP, CA) Elimina os dominios de cebola de forma consistente. O daemon Tor funciona como unha rede de aloxamento que compón sidecar e mapea un servizo oculto para o hóspede. OpenResty (``HiddenServicePort 80 -> 127.0.0.1:80``)Subdominios per-app (``<app>.<node>.onion``) están rotas polo ``Host`` header. TLS está no lado de cebola (onion v3 Xa fornece cifrado de transporte + autenticación do servidor)As apps aínda están a recibir ``X-Forwarded-Proto: https`` porque porque ``.onion`` É un contexto seguro."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``svc-net-tor`` is in the deploy, mint (or reuse) the node onion and set ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` in the host_vars."
msgstr "Cando ``svc-net-tor`` está en la semilla, (ou reutilización) Node onion e set ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` En el host_vars."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``tor_node`` is set (svc-net-tor deployed) and the URL's host is the ``primary_domain`` or a subdomain of it, swap that suffix for ``tor_node`` and force the ``http`` scheme (onion services are plaintext-only). Anything else — empty inputs, a host not under ``primary_domain``, an unparseable value — is returned unchanged, so the filter is a safe no-op on clearnet."
msgstr "Cando ``tor_node`` Está definido (svc-net-tor Despacho) O enderezo URL é o ``primary_domain`` ou tabernas pra beber, ``tor_node`` e forzar o ``http`` esquema (Os servizos de cebola son só de texto simple)Calquera outra cousa - entradas baleiras, un anfitrión non baixo ``primary_domain``, un valor inparseable - é devolto sen cambios, polo que o filtro é un non-op seguro en Clearnet."

# libretranslate
msgid "When ``version`` is unset (no services value, no override), the lookup returns the bare ``<image>`` (unpinned) and emits a ``display.warning`` so the operator notices the unpinned reference without aborting the play."
msgstr "Cando ``version`` Está inactivo (Ningún valor de servizo, ningún exceso), O espello devolve o espido ``<image>`` (sen apoiar) emite a ``display.warning`` Así, o operador notifica a referencia sen abortar a obra."

