# libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ ] A sealed instance is detectable: `/v1/sys/health` returns 503 (asserted by `test-seal-status.js`) and an alert rule fires on that condition. *An `OpenBaoSealed` alert now ships with the role itself, in `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, which the `alert_rule_roles` lookup concatenates into the Prometheus rule file. The health-code contract is asserted by the spec suite and the healthy path was confirmed live (200 in both compose and swarm), but the **firing** condition was never observed — that needs an instance deliberately sealed, which the AppRole-only admin model makes awkward to arrange in a test.* **Correction from implementation:** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, so the gauge is `vault_core_unsealed`, not `openbao_core_unsealed` — and it is unusable as an alert source here: on a healthy, demonstrably unsealed node it is emitted as `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so `== 0` would fire permanently. Use the health endpoint as the primary signal, with `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` as the metric-side corroboration. The alert rule itself is still outstanding."
msgstr "[ ] Un caso selado é detectable: `/v1/sys/health` Retorno 503 (afirmado por `test-seal-status.js`) Unha alerta de incendios nestas condicións. *An `OpenBaoSealed` alertar os barcos co seu propio papel `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, que, `alert_rule_roles` Considérese á Prometheus Arquivo de regras. O contrato co código de saúde é afirmado pola suite eo camiño saudable foi confirmado en directo. (200 tanto en forma como en swarm)Pero o **Disparando** A condición nunca foi observada - que necesita unha instancia deliberadamente selada, que o modelo de administración só de AppRole fai difícil organizar nunha proba.* **Corrección da aplicación:** OpenBao mantén o espazo de nomes métrico de Vault, polo que o gauge é `vault_core_unsealed`, no `openbao_core_unsealed` - e é inusable como fonte de alerta aquí: nun nodo san e insensiblemente silencioso é emitido como `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, así `== 0` arderían permanentemente. Use o punto final da saúde como sinal principal. `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` como a métrica corroborada. A propia norma de alerta é excepcional."

