# libretranslate
msgid "[Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) is a token-compression plugin installed via `make install-skills`. It reduces output token consumption through progressively terser communication styles. `make install-skills` copies the skills from the repository pinned as `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` in the generated `.env` (override via `custom.env`, see `docs/contributing/customize.md`); the [skills](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) repository pins every skill in its `skills-lock.json` and also supports global installs via its own `make install`. This works universally across all supported agents: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf, Cline, and more."
msgstr "[Caveman](https://github.com/JuliusBrussee/caveman) é un plugin token-compression instalado `make install-skills`. Reduce o consumo de token de saída a través de estilos de comunicación progresivamente terser. `make install-skills` Copia as habilidades do repositorio que se indican como `INFINITO_SKILLS_REPOSITORY` en el generado `.env` (Override vía `custom.env`, ver `docs/contributing/customize.md`); El [Habilidades](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/skills) Repositorio de cada habilidade na súa `skills-lock.json` Tamén soporta instalacións globais por conta propia. `make install`. Isto funciona universalmente en todos os axentes soportados: Claude Code, Codex, Gemini CLI, Cursor, Copilot, Windsurf, Cline e moito máis."

