msgid "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) runs after `update.php`. It includes the shared gateway consumer contract, then reads both globals back out of the running container with `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` and asserts the provider, the base URL and the model, so an unconfigured surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) corre tras `update.php`. Inclúe o contrato de entrada compartida do consumidor, logo le os dous globais de volta para fóra do recipiente de execución. `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` e afirma que o provedor, a URL base e o modelo, polo que unha superficie non configurada non pode chegar a un despregamento verde."

