# libretranslate
msgid "[x] Ordinary Flowise users cannot use MCP or another HTTP node to reach loopback, metadata endpoints, the container control plane, or unrelated internal services; globally disabling the SSRF check alone fails this criterion. `checkDenyList` resolves a hostname and tests every resolved address, and the built-in list denies all of RFC1918, so reaching any provider on a container network is impossible while the built-in list applies. Upstream's switch is not an off switch: with `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` the deny list becomes exactly `HTTP_DENY_LIST` instead of the built-in one merged with it. The role therefore sets the switch and supplies a list that still denies loopback, link-local, cloud metadata, multicast and reserved space, which is the \"not alone\" this criterion demands. Unrelated internal services are held out by network membership rather than by the list, the same boundary the adapter isolation probe asserts. Configuration alone proves nothing, so the deploy points a throwaway registry entry at loopback and at the metadata address and fails unless Flowise refuses both."
msgstr "[x] ordinario Flowise Os usuarios non poden usar MCP ou outro nodo HTTP para alcanzar loopback, metadata endpoints, o plano de control de contedores ou servizos internos non relacionados; inhabilitar globalmente a comprobación SSRF por si só falla este criterio. `checkDenyList` resolve un nome de host e proba cada enderezo resolto, ea lista integrada nega todo RFC1918, Así, chegar a calquera provedor nunha rede de contedores é imposible mentres se aplica a lista incorporada. O interruptor de Upstream non é un interruptor: con `HTTP_SECURITY_CHECK=false` A lista de negación é exactamente `HTTP_DENY_LIST` No canto de que un se fusionase con el. O papel, polo tanto, establece o interruptor e fornece unha lista que aínda nega loopback, link-local, metadatos na nube, espazo multicast e reservado. \"Non só\" Este criterio esixe. Os servizos internos non relacionados son mantidos fóra pola pertenza á rede en vez de pola lista, o mesmo límite que a sonda de illamento do adaptador afirma. A configuración por si soa non proba nada, polo que o despregamento sinala unha entrada de rexistro no loopback e na dirección de metadatos e falla a menos que non sexa Flowise Rexeitamos ambos."

