# libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n 1.100.1 is declared as an SSE client and a Streamable HTTP server, and its managed credentials and workflows are idempotently provisioned through supported public APIs. The server moved from 1.95.3's SSE-only trigger because Open WebUI 0.11.0 ships only a Streamable HTTP client and answered the SSE route with a POST that n8n refused with 404. `meta/mcp.yml` declares `direction: both` and `transport: streamable_http` at `/mcp/infinito-mcp`; `files/python/provision/mcp.py` renders the server workflow and `files/python/provision/client.py` the agent workflow, both through `/api/v1/workflows`. Credentials go through `/rest` because the public API of that tag exposes only create and delete for them, which cannot converge an existing one. Two idempotence defects were fixed here: the run reported `CHANGED` forever, because the public-API key it minted was found again on the next run and counted as a change, and that key was left standing in n8n afterwards although nothing read it. It is now minted per run, revoked before the run ends, and no longer reported."
msgstr "[x] n8n 1.100.1 Está declarado como cliente de SSE e un servidor HTTP Streamable, e as súas credenciais e fluxos de traballo xestionados están convenientemente proporcionados a través de APIs públicas soportadas. O servidor trasladouse de 1.95.3O sse é o único gatillo porque Open WebUI 0.11.0 nave só un cliente HTTP Streamable e respondeu a ruta SSE cun POST que n8Negouse con 404. `meta/mcp.yml` declara `direction: both` e `transport: streamable_http` En `/mcp/infinito-mcp`; `files/python/provision/mcp.py` o fluxo de traballo do servidor e `files/python/provision/client.py` fluxo de traballo, tanto a través `/api/v1/workflows`. As credenciais pasan `/rest` porque o público API Só crea e elimina para eles, o que non pode converxer un xa existente. Dous defectos de idempotencia foron fixados aquí: a execución `CHANGED` Para sempre, porque o públicoAPI A chave que se extraeu foi atopada de novo na seguinte carreira e contou como un cambio, e esa chave quedou en n.8Despois, aínda que nada o lea. Agora é acuñado por quenda, revogado antes do final da carreira, e xa non se informou."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n client nodes use exact tool include lists; server triggers require Bearer auth, expose only connected checked-in tools, and remain disabled until operator opt-in. Each client node renders `include: selected` with the provider's own `mcp.tools.allowlist`, which the discovery snapshot now carries; the node's default is `all`, so an omitted list would hand the agent every tool an upstream happens to serve. The server trigger pins `authentication: bearerAuth` against a managed `httpBearerAuth` credential, and the surface ships `enabled: false`. \"Only connected checked-in tools\" is upstream's own mechanism: `getConnectedTools` in `@utils/helpers` collects exactly what reaches the trigger over an `ai_tool` connection, so the workflow's connection map is the allowlist. The workflow previously connected nothing at all, so the trigger served an empty tool set; it now carries one checked-in read tool, `infinito_health`, with an explicit input schema."
msgstr "[x] n8Os nodos clientes usan as listas de ferramentas exactas; os activadores do servidor requiren auth Bearer, expoñen só as ferramentas verificados en conexión e permanecen deshabilitados ata que o operador opt-in. Cada nó cliente fai `include: selected` co propio provedor `mcp.tools.allowlist`, que a instantánea do descubrimento agora leva; o nodo é `all`, Así, unha lista omitida entregaría ao axente cada ferramenta que serve un upstream. O servidor activa pins `authentication: bearerAuth` Contra unha xestión `httpBearerAuth` credencial e os barcos de superficie `enabled: false`. \"Só ferramentas conectadas\" Este é o mecanismo de upstream: `getConnectedTools` En `@utils/helpers` recolle exactamente o que chega ao gatillo sobre un `ai_tool` A conexión, polo tanto, o mapa de conexión do fluxo de traballo é a lista de permisos. O fluxo de traballo previamente non conectado nada en absoluto, polo que o gatillo servía un conxunto de ferramentas baleiras; agora leva unha ferramenta de lectura revisada. `infinito_health`, cun esquema de entrada explícito."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] n8n tests cover creation, update, activation, authenticated tool listing and call, wrong/missing bearer rejection, rerun idempotence, and cleanup limited to managed resources. Creation, update, activation, rerun idempotence and the cleanup boundary are unit-tested in [test_mcp.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_mcp.py) and [test_client.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_client.py), including that a converged deployment reports `OK`, that a credential or workflow outside the managed names is never touched, and that a provider which vanished loses only its own credential. The authenticated half runs at deploy time through the shared contract probe, which opens an MCP session, lists tools against the declared allowlist, calls the read tool, and separately proves that an anonymous and a wrong-bearer probe are both refused a session. It cannot be a browser test: the bearer must not reach a Playwright environment file."
msgstr "[x] n8n probas cobren a creación, actualización, activación, lista de ferramentas autenticadas e chamada, rexeitamento do portador incorrecto/missor, idempotencia de reincorporación e limpeza limitada a recursos xestionados. Creación, actualización, activación, reincorporación e fronteira de limpeza son probados por unidade. [test_mcp.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_mcp.py) e [test_client.py](../../tests/unit/python/roles/web-app-n8n/files/provision/test_client.py), incluíndo un informe de implantación converxente `OK`, Que unha credencial ou fluxo de traballo fóra dos nomes xestionados nunca se toque, e que un provedor que desapareceu perde só a súa propia credencial. A metade autenticada desprega o tempo a través da sonda do contrato compartido, que abre unha sesión MCP, lista as ferramentas contra a lista de permisos declarada, chama a ferramenta de lectura, e proba por separado que unha sonda anónima e incorrecta son rexeitadas unha sesión. Non pode ser unha proba de navegador: o portador non debe chegar a un ficheiro de entorno Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "[x] openresty does NOT swarm-render itself. Its inventory group lists only the manager, so `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` for `svc-prx-openresty` resolves to `compose`. The role keeps its `network_mode: host` + docker-socket mount + Lua body-rewriting pipeline intact. Operationally openresty is implicitly pinned to the manager node (the only long-lived swarm node in v1 that runs host-level compose projects). Edge HA via Traefik (which requires porting the Lua injection pipeline) is tracked under [Future Extensions](#future-extensions)."
msgstr "[x] A liberdade non se autoproclama. O seu grupo de inventario só conta co administrador. `DEPLOYMENT_MODE` Para `svc-prx-openresty` resolucións para `compose`. O papel mantén a súa `network_mode: host` + docker-socket montaxe + Lua tubo de reescritura corporal intacto. A apertura operacional está implícita nodo do xestor (O único nodo de longa duración en v1 que executa proxectos a nivel de host). Edge HA via Traefik (O que precisa para cubrir o gasoduto de inxección Lua) Está rastrexado en [Extensión futura](#future-extensions)."

