msgstr "``oidc-authenticator`` e ``ldap-authenticator`` son mutuamente excluíntes (Só se pode acceder a un, ver ```tasks/01_validation.yml`` <./tasks/01_validation.yml>`__), each deriving its enablement from its bridged service flag. The OIDC/LDAP runtime configuration (provider URLs, bind DN, secrets) lives in the XWiki property templates and is read via ``lookup('config', application_id, 'secrets.credentials.<name>')``; the addon ``config:`` Só ten que realizar as coordenadas de instalación."

