# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "A única superficie HTTP de ejabberd é `ejabberd_web_admin` Sobre `/admin` (Ver [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2))Autentifica un JID espido en contra de LDAP sobre HTTP Basic, polo que non hai ningunha conexión. Keycloak redirixe a seguir e non hai control de logotipos para facer clic; a autenticación do cliente corre por riba dos portos 5222/5269 E permanece fóra do bucle Playwright, como se indica en Watch Points. `acl.admin` Tamén inclúe só o administrador JID, polo que o administrador da web rexeita todas as outras contas de forma correcta. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) Por tanto, declara `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` e `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; El `guest` A persoa e as afirmacións de dispoñibilidade de base funcionan incondicionalmente."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejabberd ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI é a única superficie comprobable de Playwright; o login do cliente XMPP pasa por riba 5222/5269 Debe ser exercido por un XMPP- Un cliente consciente fóra do bucle de proba Playwright."

# libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "A única superficie HTTP de ejabberd é ``ejabberd_web_admin`` Sobre ``/admin`` (Ver ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` A persoa e as afirmacións de dispoñibilidade de base funcionan incondicionalmente."

